{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/2cpn2ma3yvnk0wpl0qdejyzx7262c9s.mp3","text":"别走神。专心点，完成你该做的工作。如果所有人都能完成自己的工作，就算事情不会变好，至少也不会更糟。教训你？教训你干什么，我只是......在提醒自己。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/idqnlnej1bggrtxmukalk8a04cjplq6.mp3","text":"不管有什么事都等我抓到莫斯提马那家伙之后再说，这混蛋肯定是故意在我的鳞丸里放辣椒的！让开，别拦着我，今天我一定要给她一弩箭——","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/t96wvj0wlou3x9ntm48e92v56vem5gf.mp3","text":"之前我也试过学着用铳，但效果不好，就放弃了。怎么，很惊讶？铳这东西没有那么神秘，只不过是要练习......一直练到学会，或者炸膛炸到自己。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/d23m9aflm8nqknpjnrhsc6xnkqa49xv.mp3","text":"在判断有必要的时候，采取手段阻止情报泄露也是我的工作。......喂，别盯着我背后看，这翅膀贴纸是老头子们硬贴的，撕不下来！咳，总之，别指望我能告诉你什么，我只负责保守秘密。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/48/h6e926e83causwbsh2jhr4rt7hueokv.mp3","text":"过度的好奇心不是好事。对蕾缪安的妹妹来说是这样，对你来说也一样，博士。关心你？......没这回事，我只负责看着某人不泄密不闹事，除此之外的事我不关心。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/gatjxdt3kzpv05jpru2bh9drgcdmthv.mp3","text":"我去过很多国家，不是没有比拉特兰更打动我的地方，但现在我很清楚自己要的是什么。这座拉特兰城，任何人都别想伤害它。我已经不必再找谁要什么答案了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:1/17/6c08xtdjpn08st7sp32no876gxw20nn.mp3","text":"......不许叫我“苦难陈述者”，“神选监工”和“燃烧使者”也不行！够了，不管莫斯提马那混蛋还和你说了什么，现在就给我全部忘掉！立刻，马上！","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/22/qfni1dlegdz70ak6h6z2j6427z28mc8.mp3","text":"拜某人所赐，这一带的小吃街我已经熟得不能再熟了，真不知道有什么好逛的。入口边上那个射击摊上的靶子，从对面大楼的楼顶我都能射中。下次带上你一起？......我考虑一下。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/28/syfmrcfrwdqr3zm6sv04as5qmvnzcru.mp3","text":"为追求理想，人真的可以将一切弃之不顾，不惜将现有的秩序都打破？这种执着......我可以理解，但不能认同。我知道罗德岛也有你们自己的信念，希望我们不会有直接冲突的一天，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/phondqfsx8wigdahqj9jethq0u1013i.mp3","text":"居然站着睡着了......装得还挺像那么回事的，比当年学校里那群上课偷偷睡觉的家伙强。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/b36cuxks9qtgz2v5cmkm1ld2n4792gx.mp3","text":"我的职责是监视莫斯提马，在这里我也会和她一起行动，没问题吧。要取代号？......直接叫我菲亚梅塔就行，老头子们起的那些名字我已经受够了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/63/5jxbyhjclj3vs73pup86pskxdoh9nz0.mp3","text":"保留作战记录是个不错的习惯。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/buors250nes8rnciuzdpdd0xy2y1473.mp3","text":"晋升？事先说好，好不容易能用自己的名字，不许再给我什么名称奇怪的职务。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/0ziwppdpcb2m55j4q6utz2jjmqsvn2g.mp3","text":"拉特兰的规矩是谁弄坏的东西，谁自己赔。不过任务中合理的财物损失可以报销。是你让我出手，赔偿费当然也算你头上......怎么，你该不会后悔了吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6e/bgrcyojjgtr3efk4f2xve9j9xk8fu7g.mp3","text":"快点，别磨磨蹭蹭。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/bbxsu7n3olew0gmte9cgaw4g3qnvgjf.mp3","text":"可以。但我不会等跟不上的人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/lcsm1wcghvo1193f3nbesw0kd5xy655.mp3","text":"往上走，从屋顶更快。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/fbhiqmksvsq33jbvcmhuu1b3tn9uid5.mp3","text":"别闹出太大动静。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:7/74/m6mkxrf6lncjyntahvprrxfq1sr1nx4.mp3","text":"盯准了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/g5ov4nltpepo4sa0di75g69h195tueg.mp3","text":"无聊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:4/49/c34jodlbe20vowk66wq7xmtyej4ug0w.mp3","text":"我只做我该做的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/2c257wgobrd2l7ez3tjfqyarz18osxp.mp3","text":"你还有空看风景？","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:4/45/8xz9e8pq2dvx1g9f8h8dseyic9mbbqs.mp3","text":"在我面前，还有人敢眨眼？","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/af/sm9fkuyruidexquwcpgu0kb89wy4mte.mp3","text":"抱歉 ，没收住手。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/0n50kehi0gz86bbn4si96vc0a7sedw6.mp3","text":"我不喜欢破坏——除非有必要。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/23/61otmhccxr3z03hmqauq9uh67huavhc.mp3","text":"成功和失败之间没有侥幸。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/b5cj69m4uwlq5h33zkc377xyubfpkcm.mp3","text":"做得比我想的要好。在一支小队里战斗的感觉......久违了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/01/5rahy2v4e3pq18l6xzn2pkducgmw0of.mp3","text":"任务完成。理当如此，别大惊小怪。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/0hdby5p2ajrvtc1p9lv0d5wsvjp6sb5.mp3","text":"你没事就行。要是你和我一起却出了事，一定有人等着看我笑话。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:8/81/ntt9eq00gutm51m28xz0717s2hodba0.mp3","text":"抱歉 ，这次是我大意了，我会想办法补救。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/812xvmnt256x70qs3mi9vzk5acml3nr.mp3","text":"通风不错，视野很好。没问题，很方便我完成工作。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/psqvfngu4uzj4gt4lg1bhdjkigoe36a.mp3","text":"别动那个。会炸。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:5/53/adp2lyhvhp10387f45cz54k45g6hs2s.mp3","text":"博士......这是你的职位名称？很正常，很好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:4/49/k4fterw9hydm3l9mtyy8lwb78vb3kc3.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:1/18/t4cy90ugxyu0g5axs15tlof5jzrtbhd.mp3","text":"自从我接下监视莫斯提马这个任务，就很少能够安稳停在某处。东奔西走我早就习惯了，但在这种日子里能有个地方暂时休息一会，也不是一件坏事。新年快乐，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:4/41/fty2f33hb5qw9yrgiz0x4f15u4t2lyl.mp3","text":"别来无恙。","alt":"voice_cn/char_300_phenxi/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/39/qj3kqzvh72ocfeznthoff2lbhx9casp.mp3","text":"别走神。专心点，完成你该做的工作。如果所有人都能完成自己的工作，就算事情不会变好，至少也不会更糟。教训你？教训你干什么，我只是......在提醒自己。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/g10q0r6weys6m7lgm1q53po4itxtywc.mp3","text":"不管有什么事都等我抓到莫斯提马那家伙之后再说，这混蛋肯定是故意在我的鳞丸里放辣椒的！让开，别拦着我，今天我一定要给她一弩箭——","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/kotli7c9ik69i671u0ip1ug9yf1v0oc.mp3","text":"之前我也试过学着用铳，但效果不好，就放弃了。怎么，很惊讶？铳这东西没有那么神秘，只不过是要练习......一直练到学会，或者炸膛炸到自己。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/esz6wqiws9q1p8r5w0vhhyr85lg3tdv.mp3","text":"在判断有必要的时候，采取手段阻止情报泄露也是我的工作。......喂，别盯着我背后看，这翅膀贴纸是老头子们硬贴的，撕不下来！咳，总之，别指望我能告诉你什么，我只负责保守秘密。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/4ci6jlvyd139ithglz5qu5tsggmmhka.mp3","text":"过度的好奇心不是好事。对蕾缪安的妹妹来说是这样，对你来说也一样，博士。关心你？......没这回事，我只负责看着某人不泄密不闹事，除此之外的事我不关心。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/13yot0l72uzs08ck7h6a1yht5v3wlax.mp3","text":"我去过很多国家，不是没有比拉特兰更打动我的地方，但现在我很清楚自己要的是什么。这座拉特兰城，任何人都别想伤害它。我已经不必再找谁要什么答案了。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:7/74/t8x93ydd9mw0b3n6q6g6u9fdz2bi6n1.mp3","text":"......不许叫我“苦难陈述者”，“神选监工”和“燃烧使者”也不行！够了，不管莫斯提马那混蛋还和你说了什么，现在就给我全部忘掉！立刻，马上！","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/6m775nv180ny7l6jpj9f1u3wnchu6e9.mp3","text":"拜某人所赐，这一带的小吃街我已经熟得不能再熟了，真不知道有什么好逛的。入口边上那个射击摊上的靶子，从对面大楼的楼顶我都能射中。下次带上你一起？......我考虑一下。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/14/ozhymtkp1jbk60wwpx6l4egronktie4.mp3","text":"为追求理想，人真的可以将一切弃之不顾，不惜将现有的秩序都打破？这种执着......我可以理解，但不能认同。我知道罗德岛也有你们自己的信念，希望我们不会有直接冲突的一天，博士。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/pqizb77uu0q1ldqp9oy92e1n615dhue.mp3","text":"居然站着睡着了......装得还挺像那么回事的，比当年学校里那群上课偷偷睡觉的家伙强。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/1bfvbe8n8q1cz5txes2lf3e6bgo58l6.mp3","text":"我的职责是监视莫斯提马，在这里我也会和她一起行动，没问题吧。要取代号？......直接叫我菲亚梅塔就行，老头子们起的那些名字我已经受够了。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/44/deveupwa7vui2fpvz16ke0pi4a6enqa.mp3","text":"保留作战记录是个不错的习惯。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/i3umy1jnvpwm4ymim3xntzwtaq3xdbc.mp3","text":"晋升？事先说好，好不容易能用自己的名字，不许再给我什么名称奇怪的职务。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/i3tplwj3sfdilmmr40iyb9gg7xvv28b.mp3","text":"拉特兰的规矩是谁弄坏的东西，谁自己赔。不过任务中合理的财物损失可以报销。是你让我出手，赔偿费当然也算你头上......怎么，你该不会后悔了吧。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/2jne5fdfp4o1ko3rwnntmgujjj35dik.mp3","text":"快点，别磨磨蹭蹭。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/b9nz8dt44csz729vnxcnfkbo88kr5e4.mp3","text":"可以。但我不会等跟不上的人。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:0/07/hvei7g1hjygjguiwrwhyw2cyklkdmeu.mp3","text":"往上走，从屋顶更快。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/rcxopir6valo59enj3qbetocs2zi9v4.mp3","text":"别闹出太大动静。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/2i3srnbxdebkbqski7gzfnu3bxja7aj.mp3","text":"盯准了。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/kl5navt4xzwpcmzpj7e7fz57b3zuvlv.mp3","text":"无聊。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/clj5pz6ewmfdp1qfvmvmcxpijg6c09q.mp3","text":"我只做我该做的。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/rfeoiwa8p9le25xqmig4uhvayi0jjlt.mp3","text":"你还有空看风景？","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:4/47/tk113r6o80dqa4cie99em5u6c3pxc3p.mp3","text":"在我面前，还有人敢眨眼？","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/m03ghhbdz35weuwsgfxeesjf7khnobq.mp3","text":"抱歉 ，没收住手。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/ir9c8jlc83v1aq2vf5yjl5q2hf2ylwz.mp3","text":"我不喜欢破坏——除非有必要。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/87dk57xd721yk8w8i5gf892vdu8yvqp.mp3","text":"成功和失败之间没有侥幸。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/spaxy0wkof70fwt116ddy23xzjlt0tc.mp3","text":"做得比我想的要好。在一支小队里战斗的感觉......久违了。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/69/lt6kjyduw6hx5pvjhayt12szt5t5pvp.mp3","text":"任务完成。理当如此，别大惊小怪。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/mufkpp1cdp7p4p0e2lhnknws06ztdgz.mp3","text":"你没事就行。要是你和我一起却出了事，一定有人等着看我笑话。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/4u9z5lshs34bsf0rh2uvo0n2defin7p.mp3","text":"抱歉 ，这次是我大意了，我会想办法补救。","alt":"voice/char_300_phenxi/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻"